.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH SPT-EVENT 1  "event " 
.SH NAME
event \- Event bindings and sinks
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBevent\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Event bindings and sinks
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
event\-list(1)
List configured event bindings
.TP
event\-test(1)
Trigger a binding by name
.TP
event\-replay(1)
Replay historical events through a binding
.TP
event\-sink(1)
Manage event sinks
.TP
event\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  spt event list \-\-json
  spt event test ops\-pager
  spt event replay \-\-since 1h \-\-binding ops\-pager
  spt event sink test smtp\-primary \-\-json
  spt event sink list
